FirstMetHimayo: {
	// SpeakerName: Himura Mayo
	// Line1: ...I'm still alive?
	// Line2: Wait, let me make sure... Is this some kind of spirit summoning?
	// Line3: No...
	// Line4: Why is my consciousness inside a sword now?
	// Line5: My head is spinning... I can't wrap my head around what's happening at all.
	// Line6: Still, since the blade is in your hands...
	// Line7: From today onward, please take good care of me!
}

ToriiShrine: {
	// InteractHint: "[Right Click] Draw the blade"
	// SealedHint: "[Right Click] Grip the hilt"
	// InventoryFullHint: Inventory is full. Clear a slot before drawing the blade
}

ItCametoThis: {
	// Line1: Really didn't want it to come to this
	// Line2: From now on, this world is in my hands
}

HimayoEyeOfCthulhuGift: {
	// L0: Right—back home we used to have a guy who couldn't close his eyes when he slept.
	// L1: Not the creepy wide-open kind. Lids half down, staring at the beam like he was spacing out.
	// L2: Blankets tucked tight, house dead quiet. One time I walked past his window and almost yelled for help.
	// L3: Next day he was fine, hollering from the fields for me to help haul flower pots.
	// L4: Ah, talking about it… looking at that giant eye in the sky, I'm getting sleepy too.
}

HimayoEvilBossGift: {
	// L0Worm: Gross… chunk after chunk jammed in the dirt.
	// L1Worm: Reeks like a freshly turned mud ditch. Enough, I don't want to smell that again.
	// L0Brain: Brains belong properly tucked inside a skull.
	// L1Brain: Soggy and sprawled out in the open, one look and my head throbs.
}

HimayoCalamityEvilGift: {
	// L0: Don't just stand there spacing out. Catch your breath, at least.
	// L1: That clump earlier… doesn't it look a lot like spoiled red bean paste?
	// L2: Great, now I made myself hungry talking about it.
	// L3: If you're hungry too, go find something to eat. Toughing it out after a fight is the dumbest move.
	// L4: And don't wipe your hands on your face. Not because you're dirty—it'll sting your eyes, seriously.
}

HimayoSlimeGodGift: {
	// L0: Sticky, sure. But stepping in muddy sludge after rain as a kid was way worse than this.
	// L1: At least this won't seep into boots. Well… pretty tolerable, all things considered.
	// L2: Here. Ask where I pulled it from and I'll pretend I didn't hear.
}

HimayoWallOfFleshGift: {
	// L0: …It really fell. That wall of flesh collapsed.
	// L1: Not sure if I'm happy or not. Just feels like… the weather is about to turn.
	// L2: The road ahead is probably going to get a lot rougher. Just keep your wits about you.
}

HimayoAquaticScourgeGift: {
	// L0: Hold on, this fishy sea-stench on the blade…
	// L1: I live inside here! It smells like someone opened a seafood stall in my room.
	// L2: Can't even open a window—swords don't have windows!
	// L3: You sure had a blast slicing through it, shoving the whole hilt into that reek. Next time, go a little easier, will you?
}

HimayoBrimstoneElementalGift: {
	// L0: Heat's still hanging. Look at that puddle over there, still steaming.
	// L1: What happens if you stick a foot in? …Wait, I wasn't telling you to actually try!
	// L2: Anyway, don't touch it. It'll burn.
}

HimayoDestroyerGift: {
	// L0: Called "The Destroyer"… sounds scary enough.
	// L1: Turns out it's just a really long, clunky strip of scrap iron.
	// L2: Here, take this. Don't drop it on the ground—I'm not picking it up for you.
}

HimayoTwinsGift: {
	// L0: Stare at someone too long and you really can't help but laugh.
	// L1: You know that feeling, right? The harder you try to hold it in, the more your mouth curls up on its own.
	// L2: I used to have staring contests back home, and I always lost every single time.
	// L3: Looking at those two up there… never mind, thinking about it makes me want to laugh again.
}

HimayoSkeletronPrimeGift: {
	// L0: Head's still the old skull, but the body got replaced with a shiny new iron frame.
	// L1: Like someone rushed out in the middle of changing clothes—looks awkward as hell.
	// L2: Next time, get fully dressed before charging into battle, okay? I'm getting second-hand anxiety just watching.
}

HimayoCalamitasCloneGift: {
	// L0: Even mimicking the walking posture… so irritating.
	// L1: Not that I'm afraid of it… it just feels uncanny. The closer the mimicry, the faker it looks.
	// L2: Here. Ask where I pulled this from and I'll pretend I didn't hear.
}

HimayoPlanteraGift: {
	// L0: When flowers wither, you snip them right off without hesitation.
	// L1: Leaving dry stems is pointless. It takes up space and just makes people irritable.
	// L2: Flower sellers back home always did it like that—spent means cut, no lingering around.
	// L3: Ah, why am I babbling about this? You didn't come here to buy flowers from me anyway.
}

HimayoGolemGift: {
	// L0: Are your wrists still numb? Take a moment to loosen up your shoulders too.
	// L1: Striking hard stone like that sends the shockwave all the way into the center of your palm.
	// L2: My grip used to go numb from the recoil too, and it felt awful.
	// L3: And don't keep slamming the blade head-on into solid rock. If the edge chips, I'm the one who suffers!
}

HimayoCultistGift: {
	// L0: Finally quiet outside the door.
	// L1: Our ears can rest at last. That frantic chanting earlier had me wanting to cover my ears the whole time.
}

HimayoMoonLordGift: {
	// L0: That moon looming over the sky has finally dispersed.
	// L1: Can't say I feel relieved or happy…
	// L2: Just feels like something that was pressing down on our heads forever is suddenly gone, and it feels a little strange.
}

HimayoProvidenceGift: {
	// L0: Tch, the air around here is practically scorched.
	// L1: The back of my hand feels tight from the heat. Standing here is like being buried in a fire pit to roast sweet potatoes.
	// L2: Take this. Don't just stand here getting baked—let's get out of here quick.
}

HimayoPolterghastGift: {
	// L0: It's so damp here, like clothes hung indoors for a whole week that never dry out.
	// L1: Sleeping in a chilly, gloomy place like this guarantees a sore back the next morning.
	// L2: There's not even a window to air it out, and no charcoal to light a brazier.
	// L3: Finish up and let's go. Definitely don't spend the night here.
}

HimayoDevourerOfGodsGift: {
	// L0: That head earlier… was so massive that staring at it made me forget what I was even looking at.
	// L1: It felt as if a giant chunk of the sky had been violently bitten away.
	// L2: …Never mind, putting it that way probably sounds even scarier.
}

HimayoYharonGift: {
	// L0: The blade is still burning hot, and my side is sweltering too.
	// L1: Honestly, inside the scabbard right now feels no different from an oven.
	// L2: Don't rush to sheath it just yet—I'm the one getting toasted in here!
	// L3: Here, set this aside for now. We can look at it once things cool down.
}

HimayoExoMechsGift: {
	// L0: After all that deafening bombardment, my ears are still buzzing non-stop.
	// L1: Feels like someone is tapping a tiny hammer inside my skull—so annoying!
	// L2: Let's find somewhere quiet to rest up and give our ears a break.
}

HimayoSupremeCalamitasGift: {
	// L0: The atmosphere over there earlier was heavy and suffocating.
	// L1: Go catch some fresh breeze, or splash some cold water on your face… not because you're dirty, but to clear your head.
	// L2: Though… suffocating atmospheres like that, I used to be quite accustomed to them.
}

HimayoBossRushGift: {
	// L0: Hold on, don't move around yet.
	// L1: Steady your footing… you haven't even caught your breath yet. It's good to have you back.
}
